===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Shieldon|63}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*{{m|Headbutt}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Shieldon}} can learn as an [[Egg Move]], or via [[Move Tutor]] in [[Generation IV]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

